  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Duke Long asks him how the activation of common enemy hatred has gone. He is an old man with many wrinkles, thin and dry like a stick, sitting curled up from a hunchback, breathing slowly with a weak aura. His seniority surpasses Duke Long. He has rank seven cultivation level and is a member of Heavenly Court.",
      "chapters": [
        1702
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_duke_long",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court normally recruits only elite rank eight Gu Immortals, but he was acknowledged and recruited at rank seven because he cultivates human path. He wakes from the immortal graveyard because of fate Gu’s restoration.",
      "chapters": [
        1702
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "gu_fate_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has many wrinkles on his face and is thin and dry like a stick. He sits on a stone bench curled up from his hunchback, and his aura is so weak it would not be strange if he died then.",
      "chapters": [
        1702
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He says he is merely a key to activate Primordial Origin Immortal Venerable’s remnant methods and asks Duke Long to address him by name rather than as Lord. He reports that countless lifeforms has already been activated, common enemy hatred is effective in the whole of Central Continent, and that enough human will will allow people’s united hearts.",
      "chapters": [
        1702
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "remnant-methods",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_primordial_origin_immortal_venerable",
        "reg_central_continent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When enough human will has accumulated, Duke Long tells him to use it. He stands shakily as a grand and vast aura surges out, and he activates the immortal killer move people’s united hearts.",
      "chapters": [
        1705
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "killer-move-exposes-hidden-enemies",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
